WEBVTT

00:04:30.542 --> 00:04:34.184
Who knows what they're thinking
or feeling in those moments.

00:04:34.208 --> 00:04:35.518
If I move in,

00:04:35.542 --> 00:04:38.143
if I touch her like I did Vicky,

00:04:38.167 --> 00:04:43.125
I could unintentionally
revictimize her all over again.

00:04:44.333 --> 00:04:46.268
Think: respect space.

00:04:46.292 --> 00:04:48.518
Be guided by respect space.

00:04:48.542 --> 00:04:51.893
It's a simple concept with a huge impact.

00:04:51.917 --> 00:04:55.958
You can't step into that space
until you're invited.

00:04:57.208 --> 00:04:58.667
So I sat across from Monica,

00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:01.351
silent,